{"3878870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pixel Way: Prologue", "steam_appid": 3878870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Financial Quest Turned Adventure:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a reckless adventurer who burned down a tavern—and now owes 1,000,000 gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay up… or fight your way to freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step can lead to riches, danger, or absurd misfortune.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Path:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade on a volatile coin market — buy low, sell high… or lose everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 50+ enemies and elite bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter hundreds of events — from lucky bags to mysterious figures in the woods.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop Your Hero:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and allocate stat points: Strength, Intelligence, Luck, Defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons, potions, and powerful pets to aid your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress, fail, adapt — every decision counts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat &amp; Core Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based battles using normal attacks and unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use potions: Immortality, Stone Skin, Damage Boost, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step can trigger a fight — or something far worse.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Financial Quest Turned Adventure:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a reckless adventurer who burned down a tavern—and now owes 1,000,000 gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay up… or fight your way to freedom.</p></li><l